# Repo-wide ShellCheck configuration. Each disabled check is a deliberate,
# reviewed pattern in this codebase, not an unaddressed bug:
#
#   SC1007  `CDPATH= cd ...` - intentional empty assignment to neutralise CDPATH
#   SC2016  single-quoted jq programs and fake-command bodies must NOT expand
#   SC2088  literal `~/...` strings written verbatim into Git/SSH config or asserts
#   SC2119  helper functions whose arguments are optional
#   SC2120  same helpers referencing "$@" without every caller passing args
#   SC2155  `local var=$(...)` - accepted style here, exit codes are not consumed
#   SC2295  `${path#$ROOT_DIR/}` - ROOT_DIR is an absolute path with no glob chars
disable=SC1007,SC2016,SC2088,SC2119,SC2120,SC2155,SC2295
